{#
  The "what happens next" trail — the one route graphic on the Contact page
  (claude_helper/CONTACT-PAGE.md §09). Three nodes on a hairline; no dates, no
  progress bar, no invented SLA metric. Reused verbatim in the post-submit
  confirmation state, so the copy lives here once.

  Params:
    trailNodes — optional [{ label, text }]; defaults to the pre-submit wording.
#}
{% set trailNodes = trailNodes or [
  { label: "You send this", text: "Your enquiry reaches the team." },
  { label: "We read it", text: "A person reviews it — usually the same day." },
  { label: "We reply", text: "You hear from us within one business day." }
] %}
<ol>
  {% for node in trailNodes %}
  <li class="handoff-node">
    <span class="handoff-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <div>
      <p class="font-grotesk text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">{{ node.label }}</p>
      <p class="mt-0.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/60">{{ node.text }}</p>
    </div>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ol>
